    Menu --> WaitingRoom: Open/Create/Join room
    WaitingRoom --> Delay: FindAsync
    Delay --> Searching: Clock tick
    Searching --> Connecting: Match found
    WaitingRoom --> Connecting: Host starts custom
    Connecting --> Connecting: Accept ready check / load court
    Connecting --> InMatch: MatchStarted callback
    Connecting --> WaitingRoom: Ready rejected/resolved
    Connecting --> Delay: Ready rejected and local accepted
    Connecting --> Searching: RetryMatchAsync
    InMatch --> Reconnecting: Disconnect / network failure
    Reconnecting --> InMatch: Reconnect succeeds
    Reconnecting --> WaitingRoom: Reconnect deadline or host unavailable
    InMatch --> Results: ShowResult
    Results --> WaitingRoom: ReturnToRoomAsync
